    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34006" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Păsargădae</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Persagădae</span></b> ,
			ārum, f., or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Parsagăda</span></b> ,
		ōrum, n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πασαργάδαι</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a citadei in Persis</i>, <i>inhabited
				by the Magi</i>, <i>and containing the tomb of
				Cyrus</i>, now <i>the ruins of Darabgerd.</i>
			<i><span class="en">Plin. 6,
				23, 26, § 99</span></i>; <i><span class="en">6, 26, 29, §
			116</span></i> (al. Frasargida); <i><span class="en">Curt. 5, 6,
				10</span></i>.</div>
